{"ID":"20230927152101-72j4rtf","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230927152101-72j4rtf","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927152101-72j4rtf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927152108-ai6xnjm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927152108-3ep09n1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:241,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927152108-6isbav2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:309,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:366\u0026#125;","title":"柴胡","type":"doc","updated":"20230927152236"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230927152108-ai6xnjm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927152108-ai6xnjm","updated":"20230927152131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"《神农本草经》：茈（柴）胡上品：一名地熏．味苦平．生川谷．治心腹．去肠胃中结气．飮食积聚．寒热邪气．推陈致新．久服轻身．明目益精。"}]},{"ID":"20230927152125-f4gtyky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927152125-f4gtyky"}},{"ID":"20230927152108-342gc76","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927152108-342gc76","updated":"20230927152108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我想要讲到柴胡的话，首先要说柴胡在中医用药的一个特征，就是它的用量："}]},{"ID":"20230927152108-tr6vucx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927152108-tr6vucx","updated":"20230927152108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"重剂量、中剂量、轻剂量的柴胡，用起来彷佛是不同的三种药。──我们一般如果是用黄连，五分黄连是有点寒、一钱黄连是更寒、两钱黄连是蛮寒、四钱黄连是很寒、六钱黄连是太寒，对不对？"}]},{"ID":"20230927152108-wq6lcn9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927152108-wq6lcn9","updated":"20230927152121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但，柴胡不是，柴胡的状况是："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"几分柴胡是一种药性、几钱柴胡是一种药性，一两以上的柴胡，又是另一种药性"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20230927152108-v42omyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927152108-v42omyp","updated":"20230927152202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"重"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：如果我们说一碗汤里面，有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"现今剂量八钱以上的柴胡，这是治「少阳病」"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个少阳病包含了什么呢？当柴胡的浓度有这么高的时候，它是可以动到人脑的下视丘这一类的开关的，就是这些体温调节中枢、自律神经系统……这么重剂量的柴胡有这种效果。"}]},{"ID":"20230927152108-z65qnok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927152108-z65qnok","updated":"20230927152208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"中"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：如果是用一二钱到六钱之间的话（通常是用两三钱)，那是用在「疏肝解郁、调畅气机」的时候，也就是说，虽然桂林本《伤寒论》里的柴芍枳草汤，它的柴胡写到半斤这么多，但一般后代的人开宋本四逆散，用在调畅气机、疏肝解郁的时候，二、三钱就有效了，倒是不需要用到八钱以上。用八钱以上的时候，就是在治疗关系到少阳病的时候。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"只是调畅气机、疏肝解郁的话，二、三钱就好了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20230927152108-6isbav2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927152108-6isbav2","updated":"20230927152236"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"轻"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：如果是用在像补中益气汤之类的方子里的时候，李东垣的补中益气汤原方里，柴胡只放两三分，这么一点点的柴胡在干嘛？疏肝解郁？我想那是疏不了什么肝的。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"但这一点点的柴胡，可以有一个效果，就是为其它的药指路，告诉其它药说，「少阳区块往这边走」"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。比如说，在补中益气汤里面，它就把人参、黄耆的药性，指到少阳区块去。少阳区块，我们基本上把它想象成一个像网子的东西，把这些补药指到这个网子去以后，它就会沿着这个网子传导。所以，一点点的柴胡，要说它是引经也行。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"但是，傅青主说这不叫做引经，李东垣的方子里的这一点点的柴胡，它的作用叫做「升提」"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这些补气药如果遇到了这一点点的柴胡，它们就会走上「上升之路」──走到三焦这里，然后开始上升──"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以当一个人的元气整个垮下来的时候，要把元气提起来，补气药里面就要加上一点点的柴胡，这样才可以让补气药走上升提之路"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20230927152108-3ep09n1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927152108-3ep09n1","updated":"20230927152108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刘渡舟认为，柴胡治疗疾病，开郁，疏肝利胆；有和解少阳，升举阳气和疏肝解郁三个功用；另外提到三个治疗，一个是调整升降收入，就是全身气机的升降出入..."}]}]}